Spec: Standalone LinkGate publication

Purpose:
  Publish the application gateway with coherent public documentation and deployment guidance.

Owns:
  ./.gitattributes
  ./.gitignore
  ./README.md
  ./AGENTS.md
  ./THIRD_PARTY.md
  ./docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
  ./docs/DEPLOYMENT.md
  ./docs/BUILD.md
  ./docs/README.md
  ./scripts/check-repository.py
  ./.specdd/bootstrap.project.md

Structure:
  ./gateway: Source-adjacent gateway implementation and SpecDD contracts.
  ./.agents/skills: Discoverable deployment skill.

Must:
  Preserve existing runtime interfaces and exclude private identities, credentials, generated runtimes and local history from Git.
  Distinguish current experimental capabilities from later mature-release requirements.
  Keep release binaries separate from source and publish explicit version/hash metadata.
  Public deployment instructions must use reproducible commands and public example paths rather than local-session actions. Explain how an agent discovers the repository deployment skill.
